  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Eight-parts jade is a rank eight immortal material. Fang Yuan demands one hundred and fifty kilograms from Shang clan within three days. Shang clan’s immortal notes that treasure yellow heaven usually trades only up to five kilograms at a time, and that bringing out so much at once is difficult. Together with spiral dawn light and seven treasures water, it is among the immortal materials Fang Yuan gathers to construct a year essence pool.",
      "chapters": [
        1610
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-demand",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When constructing the rank eight year essence pool, Shadow Sect immortals throw eight-parts jade into the dense fog after spiral dawn light and purified, frozen seven treasures water are in place. Spiral dawn light, seven treasures water, and eight-parts jade all have excellent stretchability and merge so they do not self-disintegrate, letting the filled pool expand to ten thousand li.",
      "chapters": [
        1612
      ],
